			"notes": "# Craftmine Dailies v0.2.6\n\n- feature: added user badges for contributors and translators (if you don't have one yet, and have already contributed, email or message me on discord)\n- feature: next and previous day buttons on the specific day leaderboard screen\n- fix: fixed end screens showing '???' instead of a leaderboard place\n- fix: disallowed scrolling before april 2025 and after current month in calendar screen\n- fix: player model on run details screen is now rendered with proper light level\n- localization: added 🇱🇻 Latvian translation (thank you illersaver, [pr #6](https://github.com/5w14/craftmine-dailies/pull/6))\n- localization: added 🇨🇳 Chinese translation (thank you lanlan3292, [pr #7](https://github.com/5w14/craftmine-dailies/pull/7))\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/5w14/craftmine-dailies/compare/v0.2.5...v0.2.6"
		},
